# Age 2 from the shipped opening (Step061 play session, re-anchored Step065).
#
# Lines 1-25 are exactly balanced.jsonl (the age-1 arc: cropRotation, parks
# before growth, water before housing, purchases spread) and end at t=660 with
# pop 16/16, pollution 0, money 587, net +3/tick, verdict HEALTHY.
#
# Step065 removed the market, so nothing sells the food surplus any more and
# two things changed for this journey:
#   - the old "exact balance = mouths + 2 sold" plan is gone. A colony that
#     produces more than it eats just pins at 120/120 and the assessor calls
#     that critical, so the journey never buys the surplus farms: at pop 16
#     the arc already runs +1 food/tick and stays HEALTHY (measured).
#   - the age-2 milestone set is the four Step021 dimensions again: pop 15,
#     14 buildings, treasury 600, 5 techs. No plank project, no lumber camp.
#
# What is left to do after the arc: two more age-1 techs (masonry, tradeRoutes),
# advance, then two age-2 techs for the tech5 milestone. Nothing else is bought
# — the treasury banked during the arc covers the 450-tech bill and the 600
# threshold.
#
# Measured: HEALTHY at t=780 in Age 2 with pop 16/16, money 787 (net +5/tick),
# 34 buildings, 5 farms = 16 food and 8 wells = 16 water (both +0/tick, the
# arc's own exact balance), 15 workplaces for 15 workers, pollution 0, every
# age-2 milestone done.
